# Cloudflare Pages routing rules.
#
# Format: <from> <to> <status>
# Status 200 = rewrite (URL bar unchanged, file served from `to`)
# Status 301/302 = redirect (URL bar changes to `to`)

# Shareable seller profile URLs: canvascircle.art/@handle
# Rewrite to seller.html. The page itself reads the handle out of the URL
# path (window.location.pathname), so we don't need to pass a query param
# in the destination — and avoiding the query string keeps Cloudflare's
# rewrite-vs-redirect behavior clean. The URL bar stays as /@handle.
/@*  /seller.html  200
